{"id": "512369df865991fde7338acddcb18409e7d30cac4dd3088f6cdbb1686c55349b", "page": "news.html", "section": "__FOREIGN_INSERT__", "date": null, "archived_at": "2026-10-07T09:04:31+08:00", "html": "<div class=\"news-day\">\n\n      <div class=\"dhead\"><span class=\"ddate\">2026-09 · 模型发布与预告</span><span class=\"dbadge\">速报</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"cat c-model\">模型发布</span><div class=\"body\"><h4><a href=\"https://news.qq.com/rain/a/20260909A06NJP00\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenAI GPT-6 Astra（2026-09-03 发布）</a></h4><p>OpenAI 新一代旗舰大模型：识别屏幕像素、模拟键鼠自主操作软件界面，强化复杂推理、编程与科研任务处理，是推进智能体能力的关键一步。</p></div></div>\n\n      <div class=\"news-item\"><span class=\"cat c-model\">模型发布</span><div class=\"body\"><h4><a href=\"https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-images-2-5/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenAI ChatGPT Images 2.5 · GPT-Image-2.5 Flare / Sunburst（2026-09-08 发布）</a></h4><p>图像生成延迟最高降 50%，新增 Sketch 手绘与定点编辑；API 双模型 Flare（快·通用）/ Sunburst（高精度精修），定价 $8 / $30 每百万 token。</p></div></div>\n\n    </div>"}
